  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Nestled off scenic 30a, this stunning 2400 square foot southern-style home is your luxurious retreat in Seacrest Beach! Recently updated in 2022, and just freshly painted interior, our home has been thoughtfully designed with modern comfort, brachy vibe and a touch of coastal charm. The spacious dining area can accommodate ten quests, with additional seating at the kitchen counter, making it perfect for family gatherings or entertaining. Conveniently, located just one block from the magnificent 12,000 sq. Ft. resort pool, you can easily walk and enjoy a refreshing swim and made to order food and beverages in season at the poolside cafe. Our home boasts new cabinetry, fresh paint, Shiplap, comfortable mattresses for restful nights, granite countertops and chic coastal inspired decor. Smart TVs are available throughout the home including the combined dining /living room for movie nights or catching the latest game. A cozy living area corner offers a place to read your favorite book club novel or beach book with plenty additional seating for everyone to gather in the living area. The large screened in porch accessed through opened French doors extends the living area, ideal for morning coffee or evening cocktails and equipped with-an outdoor Weber grill. The back of our home provides a serene view of the natural surroundings and easy access to the nature trail that will take you into the Villages of Seacrest and Rosemary beach. The gourmet kitchen is fully stocked for preparing morning breakfast and after beach meals. The convenience of the free tram to the beach stops right out front- unlike other homes there is no need to walk with your beach gear to find a stop.<br>Downstairs, a coastal master with ensuite bath and tub offers peaceful sleep on one of the quietest streets in the neighborhood. Upstairs, the second-floor oversized master suite provides a private sanctuary complete with a luxurious bath, soaking tub and shower and a secluded screened porch, with plenty of room for morning yoga. Two additional bedrooms, one equipped with double bunks with a full bed below and twin on top extends beds available, the other bedroom offers with a queen bed, both with access through French doors to a sunny second floor porch and these two bedrooms share a bath with tub and shower. Our home is ideally located between the prestigious communities of Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach, giving you easy access to a variety of restaurants, both casual and upscale, shopping and events. Take a short stroll to Peddlers Village for bike rentals, music, outdoor fire pit, ice -cream and quaint seaside huts for coffee, cocktails, pizza and restaurants and shops. For a picturesque evening, head to Pescado or the Pearl Hotel’s upstairs bar and grill to watch the sunset over the Gulf. With state parks, golf courses and emerald waters at your doorstep, our home offers endless opportunities for relaxation and making memories. Whether you.re lounging in the privacy of the screened porch or exploring the vibrant communities along 30a , our immaculate home offers the perfect balance of comfort and luxury for you in one of 30a’s most desirable communities. <br>Places of interest: <br>Camp Helen state park- a scenic coastal park perfect for kayaking, birdwatching,<br>30 Avenue- A charming shopping and dining destination offering upscale boutiques, outdoor cafes and live music events<br>Rosemary Beach- known for its European inspired architect, cobblestone streets, quaint shops and beachfront pathways, ideal for a peaceful stroll,<br>Alys Beach - An upscale Mediterranean style community known for it’s all white architecture with a vibrant spirit, shops, wine tastings and restaurants.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "5 Star Gorgeous Southern Style Beach house! Great for Families- Bikes included !"
        }
      ],
